{
  "epId": 9339,
  "name": "桑娜妲",
  "desc": "<p>虹月女神。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/19/368338997/5a4d15060c70ece8ddc97b8dc2ff28c8_1143187201626326072.png",
  "menuId": 10,
  "menuName": "NPC圖鑑",
  "version": 1776877174,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物關係"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7489,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "原初之龍創造了三月女神與三輪月亮，並將她們升起至天上。在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期間，尼伯龍根囚禁了月神們，並將月亮改造成了武器。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "桑娜妲是虹月女神——第三輪誕生、同時也是最小的月亮，光輝也幾乎難以目視。但其不時現出的光暈，卻顯得尤為神秘。當「虹月」破碎後，為延續生命而與深淵結合，並變成了「赤月」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4811,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "赤月王朝通過她崇拜「赤月」與深淵。他們利用「赤月」的碎片獲取力量，並建立了一所教養院，接受來自世界之外的孩子。赤月的賢人期待能從世界之外尋找到超越神明力量的存在——即降臨者。\n月髓\n蘊含著桑娜妲力量的「虹月」碎片。赤月王朝的孑遺，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5149,
        "name": "阿蕾奇諾",
        "desc": "愚人眾執行官第四席，「僕人」。沉靜冷酷的外交官，「壁爐之家」所有孩子們畏懼又依賴的「父親」。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/04/23/142229365/672e65470bfd14b664596c2a7f7eaaf8_1361943250913204321.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "執掌著「虹月」的月髓。古老的厄月血火在她體内流淌——這是被深淵侵蝕的「虹月」力量。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9338,
        "name": "艾莉亞",
        "desc": "<p>恆月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/19/368338997/ce30b9a17f945c536def5f95f32eef47_3425005229805700263.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9340,
        "name": "卡儂",
        "desc": "<p>霜月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/19/368338997/10eaa7c4b2eecf195b650c43e85b2587_3143933073634048374.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "桑娜妲是月神中最小的一位。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7476,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "新的月神。艾莉亞、桑娜妲、卡儂將她們的權能賦予她，使她成為了「三月女神」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
