        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5202,
        "name": "裴倫埃里",
        "desc": "本書又稱《熱戀中的赫雷貝里》，初版作者自稱改編自坎瑞亞家喻戶曉的傳奇故事，但是世上已經沒有人可以佐證這點了。現在已經是數代人的集體創作了。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/03/19/eebe3d494c8e1fcae1905ec185dc3f56_7240269314425814510.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2930,
        "name": "牧童與魔瓶的故事",
        "desc": "<p>牧童在沙漠中偶遇銀瓶，以及其中囚禁的不速之客的故事。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/15/125391187/7a0a7278d7ddb0d96d13606cc45155a4_4203238623920003184.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2924,
        "name": "希魯伊與希琳的故事",
        "desc": "<p>鎮靈在夜風中講與牧童的故事，不知何來，荒誕不羈。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/18/125391187/1cf52e4ba9a7722762b61b5c22d7b42d_3636193182444141461.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 12
