        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5577,
        "name": "赤月之形",
        "desc": "色澤如赤月般刺眼的鋒利銳器。據說在某個古老的王朝中曾被視為連接兩界的禮器，但如今早已不再有人記得彼時的信仰與典儀。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/04/24/ce91a453b9a942c9ab20df0f62caa033_358081180956617633.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8836,
        "name": "紡夜天鏡",
        "desc": "由無瑕的白銀鑄就的明鏡，傳說見證了月之少女的誕生，因而被霜月之子視作至高的聖物。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/01/d28b849e0abef976114ea7ecef92960e_4616051474368823347.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2668,
        "name": "貫月矢",
        "desc": "<p>從蘭那羅的故事中得到的武器。形制如同巨大的箭矢，能夠作為槍矛使用。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/08/30/7998136/2ab37345c6972292fda8b3095c15f971_2194568173103807320.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
